       L.push("- The judgment or order placing you on deferred adjudication, and the order of discharge and dismissal - the clerk of the court that placed you on deferred adjudication. Between them they carry the offence wording, the cause number, the plea date, the start and end of the deferred adjudication and the discharge and dismissal date every waiting period runs from.");
